@startuml
left to right direction
actor "DMS Standard User" as Standard
rectangle "APGC DMS — employee workspace" {
  usecase "Create Memo draft\n[CURRENT: available to logged-in users]" as Draft
  usecase "Edit own draft / returned Memo\n[CURRENT: owner + state]" as Edit
  usecase "Submit / resubmit\n[CURRENT: owner + valid reviewer]" as Submit
  usecase "Track accessible Memo and history\n[CURRENT: visible items only]" as Track
  usecase "Dedicated My Documents / My Tasks\n[FUTURE]" as Workspace
}
Standard --> Draft
Standard --> Edit
Standard --> Submit
Standard --> Track
Standard ..> Workspace : target role-aware UX
note bottom of Draft
  The DMS Standard User group has no permission grants.
  Current actions are not role-gated. Employee accounts
  currently cannot use the configured staff-only login.
end note
@enduml
